      en: ["The church was officially inaugurated on March 18, 1906.", "Architect Gustaf Hermansson designed the building as a central church.", "It is situated at an elevation of 46 meters above sea level.", "The floor plan corresponds to a symmetrical Greek cross.", "Named after Sophia of Nassau, Queen of Sweden and Norway.", "The interior has seating capacity for approximately 1,000 visitors."],
